  "instrument_definition": "Pad: slowly attacked sine fundamentals and restrained 2nd/3rd harmonics with symmetric 0.12 Hz amplitude movement. Glass: exponentially decaying 1/2/3.01/4.02 partials, slow enough attack to remove clicks. Felt: fundamental plus exponentially damped second harmonic. No sampled instruments, field recordings, reference melody or external media."
